### URL Shortener API Tests

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api
@shortCode = rhmHDht
@googleUrl = https://www.google.com
@githubUrl = https://www.github.com
@stackoverflowUrl = https://www.stackoverflow.com
@invalidUrl = invalid-url
@emptyUrl = 

### Test 1: Shorten a URL
POST {{apiUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "{{googleUrl}}"
}

###

### Test 2: Shorten another URL
POST {{apiUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "{{githubUrl}}"
}

###

### Test 3: Get URL stats (replace shortCode variable above with actual value)
GET {{apiUrl}}/stats/{{shortCode}}

###

### Test 4: Test redirection (replace shortCode variable above with actual value)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{shortCode}}

###

### Test 5: Test invalid URL
POST {{apiUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "{{invalidUrl}}"
}

###

### Test 6: Test empty request
POST {{apiUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "{{emptyUrl}}"
}

###

### Test 7: Test with different URL
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
POST {{apiUrl}}/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originalUrl": "{{stackoverflowUrl}}"
}
